{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14102130","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14102130","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1410213001:1":{"text":"여기가 바로 저희 제련소입니다. 여기 있는 완성품은 전부 저희가 망치로 직접 만들어낸 것들이지요.","source_cn":"这就是我们的冶炼所了，所有的成品都是在这里，由我们一锤...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x885F92F1CF0EBD35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1410213002:1":{"text":"아이언비어드, 이곳의 일손은 충분하지 않나! 어째서 거짓으로 상황 보고를 한 게지?","source_cn":"铁须，我看这里人手还足够啊！你怎么能谎报情况呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDCDA2EE78F9DA6EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410213003:1":{"text":"인원이 부족한 것은 확실해요! 못 믿으시겠다면 헬라한테 가서 물어보세요!","source_cn":"就是缺人手啊！不信你去问海拉，看她怎么说？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE85AA6789E7A9EB3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410213004:1":{"text":"조금 있다 상황을 확인해 보겠지만, 손님분들 앞에서 이렇게 큰 소리를 내면, 이...","source_cn":"我待会跟她确认情况，但你当着贵客的面先嚷嚷起来，这——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x970126BECC4DDE8A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1410213005:1":{"text":"괜찮습니다! 참관과 체험 또한 저희 시찰의 중요한 부분이니까요. 여기까지 온 김에 담당자와 이야기를 나누어 보도록 하지요.","source_cn":"别介意！参观和体验也是我们视察进度的重要部分。既然来到...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x446E6EC03A739DE9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1410213006:1":{"text":"특사님! 헬라는... 성격이 괴팍해 사람을 대하는 게 익숙하지 않습니다. 아무래도 제가 나서는 것이...","source_cn":"特使大人！海拉……她脾气暴躁，不太会跟人打交道。还是让...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE6E183D6F47BEB9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1410213007:1":{"text":"저 또한 거친 사람이니, 괜찮습니다. 바로 저분이신가요? 제가 인사를 건네보겠습니다.","source_cn":"没关系，我也是个粗人。就是那位吗？我去打个招呼。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x583DF9A49AB8BC73","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1410213008:1":{"text":"아이고... 특사님, 그럼 제가 같이 가겠습니다!","source_cn":"哎……特使大人，那我陪你们一起过去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E3D0D3B868FDBD6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:弗林":{"text":"플린","source":"弗林","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:工匠铁须":{"text":"장인 아이언비어드","source":"工匠铁须","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:霍根":{"text":"호건","source":"霍根","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":3}}